seed 1: Faction: a band of outlaws, devoted to protecting old roads.
Goal: to expand into the next valley. Method: gossip and whispers.
Resources: a rich patron.
Leader: Ulric Ridgeway, chimney sweep (barely adult): tall with a stooped back. Seems prone to boasting and overly polite. Wants to make one last good trade.
seed 2: Faction: a band of outlaws, devoted to smuggling honest goods.
Goal: to protect a secret. Method: bribes and favors.
Resources: a rich patron.
Leader: Brisa Ivywood, copyist (young and restless): a hat pulled low. Seems fond of old songs and blunt without meaning harm. Wants to buy a plot of land.
seed 3: Faction: a scholars' society, devoted to guarding a single holy spring.
Goal: to end a long feud. Method: hospitality and marriage ties.
Resources: skilled craftspeople.
Leader: Arvenne Hollowell, ferry pilot (barely adult): weathered and sun-darkened. Seems nervous around animals and careful with every coin. Wants to learn a closely guarded craft.
